[{"kind":"text","text":"."}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"' (a dot). "}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"It is "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"not guaranteed"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" that the given chess position can be achieved in a real game. Specifically, there can be an arbitrary (possibly zero) number pieces of each type, the king may be under attack and so on."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"output_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Print \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"White"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\" (without quotes) if the weight of the position of the white pieces is more than the weight of the position of the black pieces, print \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Black"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\" if the weight of the black pieces is more than the weight of the white pieces and print \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Draw"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\" if the weights of the white and black pieces are equal."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"samples"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Examples"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"...QK...\n........\n........\n........\n........\n........\n........\n...rk...\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"White\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},